{"type": "info", "prompt": "A contest is about this help me win\n\n@Tangem is paying 1,000 USDC to creators who can explain one thing simply:\n\nhow to keep your crypto safe, the seedless way", "source": {"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Seedless Crypto Safety – X Post Draft</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root {\n  --bg: #070B12;\n  --surface: #0F1626;\n  --surface-subtle: #141E33;\n  --border: #1E2D4A;\n  --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n  --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n  --mint: #00E599;\n  --cyan: #00C2FF;\n  --coral: #FF4D6D;\n  --font-main: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1350px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background-color: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n}\nmain {\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1350px;\n  padding: 64px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 22px;\n}\n\n/* Header */\n.header-tag {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  background: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.12);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.35);\n  color: var(--mint);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 6px 16px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  width: fit-content;\n}\n.header-tag svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }\nh1 {\n  margin: 10px 0 6px;\n  font-size: 64px;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\nh1 span { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mint), var(--cyan)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }\n.subtitle {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 25px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* Hero Metric Strip */\n.hero-strip {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n.hero-box {\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 24px 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n.hero-box.highlight {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.08) 0%, rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.04) 100%);\n  border-color: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.4);\n}\n.stat-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.stat-num {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 68px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--mint);\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n}\n.stat-num.danger { color: var(--coral); }\n.stat-label {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n.hero-desc {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 23px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* 3‑Step Process Cards */\n.section-title-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n.section-label {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n}\n.section-note {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n.steps-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 18px;\n}\n.step-card {\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n.step-top {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.step-pill {\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 44px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: var(--surface-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n}\n.step-card h3 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 26px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n.step-card p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n.chip-spec {\n  margin-top: auto;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  background: rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.08);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.25);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 19px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Footer */\nfooter {\n  margin-top: auto;\n  background: var(--surface-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 16px 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n.footer-left {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n.badge-seal {\n  background: var(--mint);\n  color: #051A12;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"header-tag\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <path d=\"M22 12h-4\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M2 12h4\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M12 2v4\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M12 22v-4\"></path>\n        <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n      </svg>\n      X POST DRAFT\n    </div>\n    <h1>How to Keep Crypto Safe, <span>Seedless</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">🚀 @Tangem is paying 1,000 USDC to creators who can explain ONE thing simply: how to keep your crypto safe, the seedless way. #crypto #security #seedless</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Hero Strip -->\n  <div class=\"hero-strip\">\n    <div class=\"hero-box\">\n      <div class=\"stat-row\">\n        <span class=\"stat-num\">$1,000</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">USDC Prize</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">Reward for the clearest seedless‑security explanation.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-box highlight\">\n      <div class=\"stat-row\">\n        <span class=\"stat-num\">0</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Words To Steal</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">Explain crypto safety without a single seed word.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section Title -->\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"section-title-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">Key Points for Your X Post</div>\n      <div class=\"section-note\">Keep it punchy</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Steps Grid -->\n  <div class=\"steps-grid\">\n    <div class=\"step-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-top\">\n        <div class=\"step-pill\">01</div>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--cyan)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h3>Chip‑Born Keys</h3>\n      <p>Keys are generated inside a secure chip and never leave it.</p>\n      <div class=\"chip-spec\">EAL6+ Certified</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-top\">\n        <div class=\"step-pill\">02</div>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--mint)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h3>Multi‑Card Backup</h3>\n      <p>Tap 2‑3 cards together; keys sync via encrypted DH channel.</p>\n      <div class=\"chip-spec\">Zero Single‑Point Failure</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-top\">\n        <div class=\"step-pill\">03</div>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--cyan)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M6 18h8\"/>\n          <path d=\"M3 22h18\"/>\n          <path d=\"M14 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M10 10v8\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h3>NFC Transaction</h3>\n      <p>Sign and send crypto by tapping your card—no typing required.</p>\n      <div class=\"chip-spec\">Antenna Off In Pocket</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">\n      <span class=\"badge-seal\">EAL6+</span>\n      <span>Contest by Tangem • 2024</span>\n    </div>\n    <div>Sources: Tangem official brief</div>\n  </footer>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>", "size": [1080, 1350]}, "edits": ["Prepare a X post draft with this"], "created": 1792447496.177225}